mily members always visit her. MGM spoke about being blesse to be alive at her age. MGM stated that Taylor is very responsible and she is never left alone to care for herself or overnight. MGM contact number is 301- 377-0268.



It appears mother ETOH abuse that poses a potential safety risk to child; therefore, could benefit from services to assist in providing adequate care and supervision of her daughter i.e. ETOH abuse Tx.
